# Pokemon Battle

A simple Expo Go battle simulator using live PokeAPI data.

- Follow the course examples. Keep functions and comments short and clear.
- Build only setup, the fight and history. No bonus features.
- Screens in `src/app/`, reusable UI in `src/components/`, hooks in `src/hooks/`, API and SQL in `src/services/`, battle rules in `src/utils/`.
